    "updated_at": "2025-09-15T20:58:44Z",
    "body": "We met last Thursday and discussed the following topics:\n\nCustomized Built-in Elements Discussion: Alex Keng from Microsoft Edge presented [Proposal: Customized built-in elements via `elementInternals.type` #11061](https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/11061), outlining two approaches: a comprehensive solution and a more scoped-down, composability-oriented approach.  Discussion will continue on the issue.\n\n[Reference Target](https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/10707).  presented by @alice, details discussed, moving forward.\n\n@stephanieyzhang raised [FormControlRange Interface](https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/11478), general agreement to bring to stage 1.",
